@baseUrl = http://localhost:5255

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List saved transactions (empty until transactions are added)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

### Enable individual assignments for a category (replace the ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/multi-post

### Return a category to normal mode (replace the ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/multi-post

### Assign an operation to a budget post (replace the IDs)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/budget-assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{"budgetPostId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","description":"Charnière de meuble"}

### Preview the supplied Société Générale sample CSV (does not persist transactions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/preview
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=kontaBoundary

--kontaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="transactions-sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../sample/transactions-sample.csv
--kontaBoundary--

### Invalid extension returns 400 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/preview
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=kontaInvalidBoundary

--kontaInvalidBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="not-a-csv.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not a CSV file.
--kontaInvalidBoundary--
